:"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn28search8","snippet":"Note that `github-token` is optional in this action, and the input is there in case you need to use a non-default token. ... uses: actions/github-script@v9","title":"GitHub - actions/github-script: Write workflows scripting the GitHub API in JavaScript · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/actions/github-script"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn28search9","snippet":"For more info see About badges in GitHub Marketplace. ... This GitHub Action posts your test suite's coverage data to coveralls.io for analysis, change tracking,","title":"Coveralls GitHub Action · Actions · GitHub Marketplace · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/coveralls-github-action"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn28search10","snippet":"Marketplace ... Publish diff coverage report as PR comment, and create a coverage badge to display on the readme ... # GitHub Action: Coverage Diff","title":"Coverage Diff · Actions · GitHub Marketplace · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/coverage-diff"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn28search11","snippet":"- name: Publish Test Report with Pull Request Comment uses: ctrf-io/github-test-reporter@v1 ... This will create a pull request comment with a summary of the test","title":"GitHub Test Reporter · Actions · GitHub Marketplace · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/github-test-reporter"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.github.com","ref_id":"turn28search12","snippet":"You can write individual tasks, called actions, and combine them to create custom workflows in your repository.GitHub Actions are automated processes allowing you to build,","title":"GitHub Actions Cheat Sheet","url":"https://github.github.com/actions-cheat-sheet/actions-cheat-sheet.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.github.com","ref_id":"turn28search13","snippet":"GitHub Agentic Wor