{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T22:36:33.008Z","ordinal":8310,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a04adc-934d-7aa3-b352-bdba70d0f67c","turn_id":"01a05f18-d73e-7dd3-85d2-d3a848bd8fd1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_066dfde3c06b8029016a97536f7d4087d0947c9768842cdca7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The reporter workflow is now implemented and passes workflow linting. It uses only SHA-pinned GitHub-maintained actions, holds PR-comment permission only in the trusted post-CI workflow, and never checks out PR code. I’m committing that reporting foundation separately; the next interval is the behavioral release test matrix needed to restore the coverage gate honestly."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788302191510,"completed_at_ms":1788302193008}}
