{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T22:49:34.473Z","ordinal":8535,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a04adc-934d-7aa3-b352-bdba70d0f67c","turn_id":"01a05f21-150b-7a51-a8d1-626823d6c36b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_066dfde3c06b8029016a97567d078c87d08523e8e50be26662","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The test has now found a concrete production gap: `release execute --state …` persisted state at the caller-selected path, but validation still created its lock under the host’s implicit application-state directory. That breaks hermetic CI and contradicts the explicit-state design. I’m making the explicit state directory govern both lock and state persistence."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788302973053,"completed_at_ms":1788302974473}}
