{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T22:54:13.690Z","ordinal":8618,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a04adc-934d-7aa3-b352-bdba70d0f67c","turn_id":"01a05f21-150b-7a51-a8d1-626823d6c36b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_066dfde3c06b8029016a975793f28887d0862e41ede4a0b5f4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The acceptance suite now proves the critical sequence end-to-end: merged release commit → approved intent → publish → tag/push → GitHub release → durable receipt, plus retry idempotency, failed publish containment, and stale-checkout containment. It also caught and corrected the explicit-state/lock mismatch. I’m running instrumented coverage now to confirm the behavioral tests close the CI regression rather than merely adding test names."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788303252007,"completed_at_ms":1788303253690}}
