help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"tag\" -d 'Create git tags for packages in a publish plan'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"filter-plan\" -d 'Filter a publish plan down to what a publish report confirms actually succeeded, dropping anything that failed'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"release\" -d 'Create, inspect, reconcile, or execute durable release intents'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"completions\" -d 'Generate shell completion scripts'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"schema\" -d 'Print the JSON schema for a report type'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and not __fish_seen_subcommand_from add status matrix version pre validate snapshot init plan-publish publish compose-pr-body tag filter-plan release completions schema help\" -f -a \"help\" -d 'Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)'\ncomplete -c callisto -n \"__fish_callisto_using_subcommand help; and __fish_seen_subcommand_from pre\" -f -a \"enter