{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T23:08:04.029Z","ordinal":8844,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a04adc-934d-7aa3-b352-bdba70d0f67c","turn_id":"01a05f21-150b-7a51-a8d1-626823d6c36b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_066dfde3c06b8029016a975ad10e2487d08062e241ef98f681","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Implemented and pushed `738aa151` to PR #39.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added black-box durable release acceptance tests using real CLI + Git.\n- Covered happy path, retry idempotency, failed publish/no-tag safety, stale checkout/no-side-effects, and stale release-commit rejection.\n- Fixed a real CI/hermeticity bug: `--state` now also controls the release lock location.\n- Fixed Nextest JUnit config compatibility.\n\nValidation:\n- `just fmt-check` passed.\n- `just lint` passed.\n- Full `just test` completed successfully (1,250 tests).\n- Instrumented coverage is now 92.22% overall, clearing the 90% CI gate.\n\nThe release path now has behavior-focused coverage rather than relying on unit-level implementation coverage alone."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1788304081077,"completed_at_ms":1788304084029}}
