{"timestamp":"2026-09-02T02:59:20.146Z","ordinal":8871,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a04adc-934d-7aa3-b352-bdba70d0f67c","turn_id":"01a0600e-0262-7e41-937d-39490f5db101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_066dfde3c06b8029016a979106dc0087d0a52b6c84e2dbd229","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The three failures have one root cause: CI now runs `just test-ci`, but the workflow never installs `cargo-nextest`. Both OS test jobs and the coverage job therefore stop before tests; the report job is only downstream fallout. I’m fixing the workflow setup rather than touching release code."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788317958877,"completed_at_ms":1788317960146}}
